{"date":"2026-11-06","decided_at":"2026-11-06T04:35:11+00:00","hash":"6eb6761aae1b25f62656f426b772a71f8caae3886975054106ca96cb45892e30","market_summary":"The main event this week was the Democratic sweep of both chambers of Congress in the US midterms. Traders took it as raising the odds of ending the Iran war, and Brent fell roughly 8-9% on Wednesday to a near two-month low. It was trading around $96-97 on Nov 5, well below the stale $107.03 Nov 3 mark. Hormuz risk has not gone away: the IRGC said two tankers and a tugboat caught fire on Nov 5 after allegedly using unauthorised routes. The Fed held at 3.75-4.00% on Oct 28, with two dissents in favour of a hike and markets pricing another hike. The US 10y is about 4.90% and the 2y about 4.59%. USD/JPY is near 158.4 with intervention worries, and the OAT-Bund spread is about 150bp after nearing 175bp on Oct 22 while the 2027 budget goes through the Assembly.","model":"claude-opus-5-5","n_new":0,"n_reviews":0,"prev_hash":"d7d7548cc8d4b5d1efaf0d906b1b92754494598d2bb9b35831a592da4d4e7e87","prompt_sha256":"8d472ea6d24ebfac2eeaf3330b7585cc7ffc243677927709f153d8321a979cb4","recorded_at":"2026-11-06T04:36:17+00:00","request_id":"","rule_notes":[],"searches":12,"seq":2,"sources_read":[{"title":"2017%E2%80%932019 world oil market chronology","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2017%E2%80%932019_world_oil_market_chronology"},{"title":"Crude oil prices fall below $90 a barrel as Vance blames GOP election defeat on Iran war","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/04/oil-price-iran-war-us-election-strait-hormuz.html"},{"title":"U.S. stocks surge, and the Dow soars 1,500 points as Brent oil's price drops below $95 per barrel","url":"https://www.pbs.org/newshour/economy/u-s-stocks-surge-and-the-dow-soars-1500-points-as-brent-oils-price-drops-below-95-per-barrel"},{"title":"Oil Prices Plunge as Draft Proposal to End U.S.-Iran War is Circulated","url":"https://oilprice.com/Latest-Energy-News/World-News/Oil-Prices-Plunge-as-Draft-Propos