{"date":"2026-11-06","decided_at":"2026-11-06T12:11:53+00:00","hash":"5e391177474156a15a9825fc589d0e5b2ec35e0c2ef476413e324b324c63ce76","model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","prev_hash":"db03f71f2098b676c75c65ce9aed2c48a01483ae94087b2aa12ba1f99a34fc6e","reasoning":"No position where I can defend an edge above 50% with evidence in this session. Energy marks are three days stale and estimated, after a violent 13% weekly Brent move, so a stop and entry would be set against an unreliable level. Rate and FX moves this week are modest and I have no independent catalyst view; the FR-DE widening is a trend I cannot confidently call to reverse. Staying flat is the correct decision.","recorded_at":"2026-11-06T12:11:53+00:00","run_seq":5,"seq":6,"type":"no_trade"}
